---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-white/10 py-12">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <span class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-brand text-[#0A0A0A]">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M13 2 4.5 13.5H11L10 22l8.5-11.5H12L13 2Z" fill="currentColor"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span class="font-display text-lg uppercase tracking-[0.12em]">Fit<span class="text-brand">Now</span></span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-ink-2">Studio GroupX cao cấp — tập theo nhóm, bùng cháy năng lượng.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-ink">Khám phá</h4>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-1 text-sm text-ink-2">
          <li><a href="#lop-hoc" class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center hover:text-ink">Lớp học</a></li>
          <li><a href="#lich-tap" class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center hover:text-ink">Lịch tập</a></li>
          <li><a href="#hlv" class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center hover:text-ink">HLV</a></li>
          <li><a href="#bang-gia" class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center hover:text-ink">Bảng giá</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-ink">Liên hệ</h4>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-1 text-sm text-ink-2">
          <li class="py-2">Phòng Group X FIT NOW · Ocean Park 1</li>
          <li><a href="tel:+84901234567" class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center hover:text-ink">0901 234 567</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://zalo.me/84901234567" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center hover:text-ink">Zalo: 0901 234 567</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-ink">Giờ mở cửa</h4>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-ink-2">
          <li>Mỗi ngày: 5:30 – 21:00</li>
          <li>6 ca tập hàng ngày</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 text-xs text-ink-muted sm:flex-row">
      <p>© {year} FIT NOW. All rights reserved.</p>
      <div class="flex gap-6">
        <a href="#" class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center hover:text-ink">Chính sách bảo mật</a>
        <a href="#" class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center hover:text-ink">Điều khoản sử dụng</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
